WEBVTT

00:42:29.666 --> 00:42:31.443
and it's not what her death was like.

00:42:31.467 --> 00:42:32.811
She went down swinging.

00:42:32.835 --> 00:42:36.697
I mean, I said to her ex-wife GiGi,
who was in the room --

00:42:36.721 --> 00:42:39.696
the really beautiful thing that happened
at the end of her life

00:42:39.720 --> 00:42:42.796
was that the three women
who took care of her while she was dying

00:42:42.820 --> 00:42:44.908
were her ex-wife,
her ex-girlfriend and me,

00:42:44.932 --> 00:42:47.238
and it just shows how loved she was.

00:42:47.262 --> 00:42:51.216
She was so devoutly loved by all of us,

00:42:51.240 --> 00:42:54.147
and we just came together
as her wives, really.

00:42:54.171 --> 00:42:56.501
It took three of us because
she was so hardcore,

00:42:56.525 --> 00:42:58.055
and she was not an easy patient,

00:42:58.079 --> 00:43:00.337
and she didn't have a zen death.